Shaft wrote:
>     What are some good tips for keeping a priest alive?  

You should run away.  A lot.  Make sure you always have a path to the
exit, that you don't get surrounded (use corridors), and that you
have plenty of power for healing spells or potions of healing
for emergencies.  Stay away from monsters that deal a lot of damage
like soldier ants and leocrottas until you get a decent armor
class.

What are good combat tips?  Should I wail away or use
> magic?  

Use magic for ranged attacks and try to avoid wailing away unless
you're going up against relatively weaker characters.  Try to
stay on the upper levels of the dungeon until you can pretty much
beat anything that comes at you with ease.  Make sure you don't
run too low on food though, desperate searching is very dangerous.

